      "dcterms:title": "Caregiver",
      "dcterms:description": "Mother, father, guardian, carer of the child, infant, elderly or disabled person.\n\n**Alternate names**: Parent, guardian.\n\nA related generic persona of the WHO Digital Adaptation Kit for Immunizations.",
      "dcterms:type": "Requirements: Actor Definitions",
      "schema:sameAs": {
